graph LR
    subgraph "Development Environment"
        Dev[Dev Machine] -->|git push| Git[(GitHub / Gitea)]
    end

    subgraph "NixOS Server (Target)"
        Git -->|nixos-rebuild| Flake[Flake Loader]
        Flake -->|Evaluates| Config[Nix System Config]
        Config -->|Generates| Systemd[Systemd Units]
        Systemd -->|Manages| Docker[Docker Engine]
        Docker -->|Runs| Cont[Nix-Defined Containers]
    end
    
    style Git fill:#f96,stroke:#333
    style Flake fill:#3498db,color:#fff
